 id="startsAt" class="min-h-[44px] w-full rounded-sm border bg-surface px-3.5 text-base text-text placeholder:text-text-dim focus:bg-raised  border-line focus:border-text" type="datetime-local" value=""></div></div><div class=""><label for="deadline" class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-medium text-text">Cierra</label><div class="relative"><input id="deadline" class="min-h-[44px] w-full rounded-sm border bg-surface px-3.5 text-base text-text placeholder:text-text-dim focus:bg-raised  border-line focus:border-text" type="datetime-local" value=""></div></div></div></fieldset></div><div class="rounded-sm border border-line bg-surface p-4 p-5 lg:p-6"><fieldset><legend class="text-base font-semibold text-text">Tu marca</legend><div class="mt-4 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2"><div class="sm:col-span-2"><label for="sponsorLogo" class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-medium text-text">Logo (opcional)</label><input id="sponsorLogo" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp" class="block w-full text-sm text-text-dim file:mr-3 file:min-h-[44px] file:rounded-sm file:border file:border-line file:bg-surface file:px-4 file:text-sm file:text-text" type="file"><p class="mt-1.5 text-2xs text-text-dim">PNG, JPG o WebP. Saldrá junto a «Patrocinado por» con el nombre de tu empresa.</p></div></div></fieldset></div><div class="sticky bottom-[calc(3.9rem+env(safe-area-inset-bottom))] z-20 -mx-4 border-t border-line bg-void/95 px-4 py-3 backdrop-blur-md sm:mx-0 sm:rounded-sm sm:border lg:static lg:border-0 lg:bg-transparent lg:p-0 lg:backdrop-blur-none"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:gap-4"><button type="submit" class="inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-sm border px-5 text-sm font-semibold transition-[filter,background-color,border-color] duration-150 ease-mechanical disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-40 disabled:hover:brightness-100 disabled:hover:bg-transparent bg-action text-void border-transparent hover:brightness-110 w-full shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap sm:w-auto">Enviar propuesta</button></div></div></form></div><aside aria-label="Cómo funciona" class="space-y-4 lg:sticky lg:top-24"><div class="rounded-sm border border-line bg-surface p-4 p-5"><h2 class="text-2xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-text-dim uppercase">Después de enviar</h2><ol class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-text-dim"><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="w-4 shrink-0 font-semibold text-text tabular-nums">1</span><span>La revisamos a mano y te escribimos en cuanto la decidamos.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="w-4 shrink-0 font-semibold text-text tabular-nums">2</span><span>Si la aprobamos, la preparamos con tu marca.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="w-4 shrink-0 font-semibold text-text tabular-nums">3</span><span>La publicamos en cuanto recibimos el pago.</span></li></ol></div><div class="rounded-sm border border-line bg-surface p-4 p-5"><h2 class="text-2xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-text-dim uppercase">El pago</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text">El pago se hace por transferencia, fuera de RevolFlash. Cuando aprobemos tu reto, te escribiremos para organizarlo, y lo publicaremos en cuanto lo recibamos. Quien gane cobra el premio entero.</p></div><p class="text-2xs text-text-dim">Puedes tener hasta 3 propuestas esperando a la vez.</p></aside></div></div>"`;

