</div></div></fieldset></div><div class="rounded-sm border border-line bg-surface p-4 p-5 lg:p-6"><fieldset><legend class="text-base font-semibold text-text">Tu marca</legend><div class="mt-4 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2"><div class="sm:col-span-2"><label for="sponsorLogo" class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-medium text-text">Logo (opcional)</label><input id="sponsorLogo" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp" class="block w-full text-sm text-text-dim file:mr-3 file:min-h-[44px] file:rounded-sm file:border file:border-line file:bg-surface file:px-4 file:text-sm file:text-text" type="file"><p class="mt-1.5 text-2xs text-text-dim">PNG, JPG o WebP. Saldrá junto a «Patrocinado por» con el nombre de tu empresa.</p></div></div></fieldset></div><div class="sticky bottom-[calc(3.9rem+env(safe-area-inset-bottom))] z-20 -mx-4 border-t border-line bg-void/95 px-4 py-3 backdrop-blur-md sm:mx-0 sm:rounded-sm sm:border lg:static lg:border-0 lg:bg-transparent lg:p-0 lg:backdrop-blur-none"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:gap-4"><button type="submit" class="inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-sm border px-5 text-sm font-semibold transition-[filter,background-color,border-color] duration-150 ease-mechanical disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-40 disabled:hover:brightness-100 disabled:hover:bg-transparent bg-action text-void border-transparent hover:brightness-110 w-full shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap sm:w-auto">Enviar propuesta</button><p role="alert" class="text-sm text-alarm">El premio no es válido. Usa un importe como 50 o 49.90.</p></div></div></form>"`;

